# ==============================================================================
# LabFlow Email Dispatch Configuration
# ==============================================================================
#
# By default, clicking "Email Parent" automatically opens Gmail Web with
# the recipient, subject, full clinical report summary, and PDF link pre-filled
# so you can send it immediately with zero setup!
#
# If you want automated HEADLESS background sending (without opening Gmail):
#
# OPTION 1: Gmail SMTP (Send directly from your own Gmail address)
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification
# 2. At the bottom, go to "App passwords": https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Create an app password for "LabFlow" (gives a 16-letter code like "abcd efgh ijkl mnop")
# 4. Copy this file to "frontend/.env.local" and uncomment below:
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=your_16_char_app_password
#
# OPTION 2: Resend API (Free 100 emails/day: https://resend.com)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here
